r:\u00a0 Gris<\/li><li>Interfaz:\u00a0 USB 2.0-A macho\/USB 2.0 Micro-B macho (reversible)<\/li><li>T\u00e9cnicas de interfaz:\u00a0 niquelado<\/li><li>Velocidad de transmisi\u00f3n:\u00a0 480Mbps<\/li><li>Conductor:\u00a0 cobre esta\u00f1ado<\/li><li>Carcasa:\u00a0 aleaci\u00f3n de aluminio<\/li><li>Blindaje:\u00a0 Papel de aluminio<\/li><li>Chaqueta:\u00a0 TPE + nailon trenzado<\/li><li>AWG:\u00a0 0,25-2M: 22+30AWG; 3M-20+28AWG<\/li><li>Di\u00e1metro exterior:\u00a0 3,4 mm<\/li><li>Fuente de alimentaci\u00f3n:\u00a0 3A<\/li><\/ul><\/p><p>El cable micro USB reversible Vention es un accesorio esencial para cualquier persona que tenga dispositivos micro-USB. Su combinaci\u00f3n de carga r\u00e1pida, transferencia de datos confiable, construcci\u00f3n duradera y caracter\u00edsticas convenientes lo convierten en una opci\u00f3n perfecta para el uso diario, el trabajo y los viajes.<\/p><br><\/div>                                            ","2":"","3":"","4":""},"description_short":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_description":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_keywords":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"meta_title":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"link_rewrite":{"1":"","2":"","3":"","4":""},"visibility":"both","manufacturer_name":"VENTION","supplier":null,"width":null,"height":null,"depth":null,"weight":0,"unit_price":7.12,"unit_price_tax":7.12,"tax_rules_group":null,"category":"Cables","sub_category":"Cable USB","quantity":0,"brand":"VENTION","images":["https:\/\/cdn2.depau.es\/articulos\/800\/800\/fixed\/art_ven-cab%20coahh_1.jpg"],"wholesale_price":2.12}}},"6922794752429":{"result":true,"need_alert":true,"report":{"notes":{"product":["",false],"ean13":["6922794752429",false],"wholesale_price":[0.92,false],"price":[5.92,false],"id_tax_rules_group":[1,false],"categorys":["1 categorys",false],"weight":["Product weight is 0",true],"images":["Create 1 images",false],"tags":["Product without tags",false],"features":["Product without features",true],"combinations":["Produ